{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14919","headline":"秋中过独孤郊居 · 卢纶","name":"秋中过独孤郊居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"开园过水到郊居，共引家童拾野蔬。\n高树夕阳连古巷，菊花棃叶满荒渠。\n秋山近处行过寺，夜雨寒时起读书。\n帝里诸亲别来久，岂知王粲爱樵渔。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢纶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14919.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14919","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}